    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōjectīcĭus</span></b>  or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-tĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		proicio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>cast out</i>, <i>exposed</i> (ante-
			and postclass.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Cist. 1, 3, 43</span></i>
			; cf. Argum. Cist. 8.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Palladius projecticius,</span>”
				<i>rejected</i>, <i>despised</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 28, 6, 26</span></i>
			.</div>
